00:14:23,020 --> 00:14:24,900
but when we started
training models

306
00:14:24,900 --> 00:14:27,210
and started looking at
the evaluation results,

307
00:14:27,210 --> 00:14:28,950
we were like, you
know, if we had

308
00:14:28,950 --> 00:14:31,980
to go back and change things,
how would we change that?

309
00:14:31,980 --> 00:14:33,720
And so these were
like things that we

