00:23:44,300 --> 00:23:46,040
that I showed a few
slides earlier, which

512
00:23:46,040 --> 00:23:48,410
was on a scale of one
to eight but essentially

513
00:23:48,410 --> 00:23:50,160
ranking between
these two models,

514
00:23:50,160 --> 00:23:52,220
and then LLaMA2
came out while we

515
00:23:52,220 --> 00:23:54,000
were in this iterative process.

516
00:23:54,000 --> 00:23:56,060
And iterative process
was essentially

517
00:23:56,060 --> 00:23:58,370
