endpoint to the vendor,

518
00:23:58,370 --> 00:24:01,010
and then basically
the annotators

519
00:24:01,010 --> 00:24:03,080
that they had in the
manage task force

520
00:24:03,080 --> 00:24:04,830
would prompt these end points.

521
00:24:04,830 --> 00:24:06,800
The model would
respond to response,

