00:26:28,370 --> 00:26:32,780
that we tried, which is using
synthetic dataset essentially

580
00:26:32,780 --> 00:26:35,870
for distillation of AI
alignment, which is basically

581
00:26:35,870 --> 00:26:39,500
the paper that we released
last week called Zephyr,

582
00:26:39,500 --> 00:26:43,250
and which was like a 7 billion
parameter model, which actually

583
00:26:43,250 --> 00:26:44,780
beat ChatGPT.

584
00:26:44,780 --> 00:26:47,960
And this builds on top
of the Mistral model,

585
00:26:47,960 --> 00:26:50,210
but I just wanted to like--

586
00:26:50,210 --> 00:26:52,670
basically, we recreated some
of the steps that were there

587
00:26:52,670 --> 00:26:54,920
on the InstructGPT
paper, but now

588
00:26:54,920 --> 00:26:57,350
with using synthetic dataset.

589
00:26:57,350 --> 00:26:59,660
And so the first one
is like, you know,

590
00:26:59,660 --> 00:27:01,850
you are basically
using a dataset.

591
00:27:01,850 --> 00:27:03,660
In this case, we use UltraChat.

592
00:27:03,660 --> 00:27:06,110
So this is a data set I
