593
00:27:06,110 --> 00:27:08,810
for supervised fine-tuning
wherein a human was

594
00:27:08,810 --> 00:27:11,210
brainstorming and
gathering the material,

595
00:27:11,210 --> 00:27:14,600
and then chatting
with this GPT model

596
00:27:14,600 --> 00:27:19,140
to generate multiple different
outputs for the instruction,

597
00:27:19,140 --> 00:27:21,620
and then know this is how
