598
00:27:21,620 --> 00:27:25,220
which is called the UltrChat,
and then we use that for fine

599
00:27:25,220 --> 00:27:26,580
tuning our model.

600
00:27:26,580 --> 00:27:30,960
And then the second step is the
response generation AI ranking.

601
00:27:30,960 --> 00:27:35,150
So in this case, we used
