718
00:32:52,050 --> 00:32:55,010
So instead of humans sitting
and rating each of you're

719
00:32:55,010 --> 00:33:00,040
asking GPT-4 to select
which is a better response.

720
00:33:00,040 --> 00:33:02,110
Yeah, and so this is
basically the first table

721
00:33:02,110 --> 00:33:04,690
you're showing if you
allow ties in the sense--

722
00:33:04,690 --> 00:33:06,410
sorry, if there
was no tie allowed,

